# level_dt.vmus: levels 5-6, Dogtown industrial district.
# Original composition for this project (docs/design/audio.md, Music).
# Mood: industrial noise percussion, square bass. D "Egyptian" pentatonic
# (D E G A C): the title motif returns as a thin 12.5% square lead.
# Channels: 0 lead/stabs, 1 metal (clanks, steam), 2 square bass, 3 drums.
# Tempo 4: 4 rows per beat = 131 BPM, one pattern = 64 x 4 / 35 = 7.31 s.
vmus 1
tempo 4

inst 01 square   vol=52 a=0 d=6 s=36 r=2 duty=128   # bass, 50% duty
inst 02 square   vol=34 a=1 d=8 s=30 r=4 duty=32    # lead, 12.5% duty
